1
00:00:00,397 --> 00:00:01,667
(Leonard:)What, you actually
want to meet her?

2
00:00:01,665 --> 00:00:03,035
(Penny:)No, but now that you're
being weird about it,

3
00:00:03,033 --> 00:00:04,103
(Penny:)maybe I should.

4
00:00:04,101 --> 00:00:05,131
(Leonard:)I'm not being weird.

5
00:00:05,135 --> 00:00:06,165
(Leonard:)Am I being weird?

6
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:08,840
(Sheldon:)Yes.

7
00:00:08,839 --> 00:00:11,509
(Sheldon:)And that's coming from me.

8
00:00:12,376 --> 00:00:14,106
(Leonard:)Fine, you want to meet her?

9
00:00:14,111 --> 00:00:15,911
(Penny:)No, I just want to know
that when you're at work,

10
00:00:15,913 --> 00:00:17,343
(Penny:)there's nothing going on.

11
00:00:17,348 --> 00:00:18,718
(Leonard:)How many times
do I have to tell you?

12
00:00:18,716 --> 00:00:20,286
(Leonard:)I have no interest
in this woman.

13
00:00:20,284 --> 00:00:21,714
(Penny:)Yeah, well, maybe she
has interest in you.

14
00:00:21,719 --> 00:00:23,189
(Sheldon:)In Leonard?

15
00:00:23,187 --> 00:00:25,617
(Sheldon:)Oh, even the Sparkletts guy
could see that's unlikely.

16
00:00:31,216 --> 00:00:34,246
(Penny:)I guess my big problem is
I never saw Leonard

17
00:00:34,252 --> 00:00:37,282
(Penny:)as the kind of guy who would
do something like this.

18
00:00:37,288 --> 00:00:39,958
(Amy:)Anybody can make a mistake
in a weak moment.

19
00:00:39,958 --> 00:00:42,028
(sighs)
What do you think?

20
00:00:42,894 --> 00:00:44,724
Oh, I don't know what to think.

21
00:00:44,729 --> 00:00:47,869
(Bernadette:)But then again,
I just found out about it.

22
00:00:49,668 --> 00:00:51,798
(Penny:)You know, I fell in love
with Leonard

23
00:00:51,803 --> 00:00:53,403
(Penny:)because he wasn't
anything like the guys

24
00:00:53,405 --> 00:00:54,735
(Penny:)I was used to dating.

25
00:00:54,739 --> 00:00:56,569
(Penny:)I mean, I knew those guys
weren't above cheating

26
00:00:56,574 --> 00:00:59,644
(Penny:)because that's usually
how we met.

27
00:00:59,644 --> 00:01:01,974
(Amy:)Come on, you know
Leonard's not like that.

